# ANIM-12: the same three drawings in each layer and order. Drawing 23
# is a child of drawing 21 and follows it; drawing 1 is a background
# drawing (G0). At tick 0 all three are in layer 1 at order 0, drawn by
# number.
# Within a layer the order decides, lowest first.
1 order 20 keep 5
2 order 22 keep -5
# A higher layer wins whatever the order.
3 order 21 2 -128
4 order 20 3 -128
5 order 22 3 127
# Equal orders in one layer: the number decides, and 22 stays over 20.
6 order 22 3 -128
# Each drawing in the background layer, under the others; among equal
# orders the number decides, so drawing 1 is beneath them.
7 order 21 0 0
8 order 20 0 0
9 order 22 0 0
# A lower order than drawing 1's puts drawing 22 beneath it.
10 order 22 0 -1
# Back through layers 1 and 2.
11 order 20 1 0
12 order 21 1 0
13 order 22 2 0
14 order 21 3 0
15 order 20 2 1
